WEBVTT

00:04.801 --> 00:07.139
-[Stanley humming]
-[footsteps approaching]

00:08.517 --> 00:11.982
[Stanley] Synchronization between
the Loki and the Foulbout is now complete.

00:12.483 --> 00:14.195
How exciting!

00:14.278 --> 00:17.577
This is the moment my research
finally sees the light of day.

00:18.119 --> 00:21.459
Now all that's left is to activate
the program that will automatically

00:21.544 --> 00:24.382
identify and eliminate
Neo-Britannia's enemies.

00:24.800 --> 00:25.802
I know!

00:25.885 --> 00:27.806
I should go on-site to collect data--

00:27.889 --> 00:29.225
[Norland] You're done here.

00:30.477 --> 00:32.649
Be gone from this place.

00:33.734 --> 00:34.736
What?

00:34.820 --> 00:36.155
[mech trills]

00:37.826 --> 00:40.707
[Stanley] No... You can't be serious.

01:01.122 --> 01:04.045
WAIKIKI

01:09.973 --> 01:11.602
RIO DE JANEIRO

01:11.685 --> 01:13.773
[people screaming]

01:25.672 --> 01:28.051
DUBAI

01:35.650 --> 01:39.031
PORT OF KOBE

01:48.174 --> 01:50.513
Hey, what the hell is that thing?

01:50.596 --> 01:53.393
Obviously an enemy,
in case you couldn't tell.

01:53.686 --> 01:55.105
It makes my skin crawl.

01:55.982 --> 01:57.986
Leila, your orders.

01:58.612 --> 02:00.073
Right, leave it to me.

02:00.950 --> 02:02.077
[Suzaku] Who sent these things?

02:02.161 --> 02:03.163
ZILKHSTAN AIRPORT

02:06.294 --> 02:08.674
How dare they threaten humanity's peace!

02:09.509 --> 02:10.553
BRITANNIA REPUBLIC

02:10.636 --> 02:13.016
[Oldrin] I've taken out all the machines
in the right lane,

02:13.517 --> 02:15.479
but this is never-ending.

02:16.063 --> 02:18.401
Control room, status report.

02:19.069 --> 02:21.157
[operator 1]
<i>Multiple units approaching from the east.</i>

02:21.240 --> 02:24.163
<i>They appear to be reinforcements
for the unidentified intruders.</i>

02:24.246 --> 02:26.167
[Oldrin] <i>What? Reinforcements?</i>

02:26.502 --> 02:28.756
Looks like this is gonna be a tough one.

02:29.549 --> 02:30.551
CAPE TOWN

02:30.635 --> 02:34.058
[operator 1] <i>We are currently engaging
unidentified intruders in 48 major cities.</i>

02:34.225 --> 02:37.356
[operator 2] <i>Due to escalating damage
along the coast of the Britannia Republic,</i>

02:37.439 --> 02:38.692
<i>some front lines are pulling back.</i>

02:39.068 --> 02:41.155
[operator 3] <i>Areas
with limited Knightmare Frame</i>

02:41.239 --> 02:42.742
<i>deployment are in a state of collapse.</i>

02:42.825 --> 02:44.370
BLACK KNIGHTS CRISIS MANAGEMENT OFFICE

02:44.453 --> 02:48.127
Understood. Send out requests for support
from PMCs and retired soldiers.

02:48.754 --> 02:51.969
Gather as many who can pilot a Knightmare
as possible!

02:52.052 --> 02:55.475
Wait! Independent military action
violates the Charter of the United--

02:55.560 --> 02:56.853
There's no time for that!

02:56.937 --> 02:59.233
So long as the enemy's identity
is unknown,

02:59.316 --> 03:01.279
we'll handle this as a natural disaster!

03:02.072 --> 03:03.993
I'll take full responsibility!

03:07.207 --> 03:09.504
Has any new information come in?

03:10.130 --> 03:11.592
[Kuroto] <i>Numerous unidentified machines</i>

03:11.675 --> 03:14.430
<i>have reportedly appeared
within the Luxembourg Domain.</i>

03:14.931 --> 03:17.311
<i>The scale of the enemy is still unknown.</i>

03:17.687 --> 03:18.897
I see...

03:18.981 --> 03:20.233
[incoming call notification]

03:20.651 --> 03:22.070
[Rozé] Natalia?

03:23.364 --> 03:24.909
<i>Thank goodness you're all right!</i>

03:25.243 --> 03:27.582
Are you okay over there?

03:27.665 --> 03:30.838
Yes, I managed to get to
a military shelter...

03:30.963 --> 03:32.257
-[explosion]
-[people exclaim]

03:32.341 --> 03:35.598
From the looks of it,
they're attacking indiscriminately.

03:35.931 --> 03:39.564
Could it be a force
other than the Neo-Britannia military?

03:39.648 --> 03:41.067
[Natalia] <i>If so, the imperial palace...</i>

03:41.150 --> 03:43.572
<i>Empress Sakuya's manor
might also be in danger.</i>

03:44.949 --> 03:46.452
<i>I'm safe here,</i>

03:46.536 --> 03:47.997
<i>so hurry and rescue the Empress--</i>

03:49.876 --> 03:50.920
Natalia?!

03:51.212 --> 03:53.007
[mechanical clanging]

04:00.063 --> 04:01.942
[trills]

04:05.115 --> 04:07.119
[♪ opening theme song playing]

05:36.506 --> 05:37.675
BLACK KNIGHTS HACHINOHE BASE

05:37.758 --> 05:39.888
[KMF captain]
<i>Unknown unit approaching command center.</i>

05:39.971 --> 05:41.766
<i>Deploy three-pronged attack. Destroy it!</i>

05:41.850 --> 05:42.852
[KMF soldiers] <i>Roger!</i>

05:55.460 --> 05:56.462
[grunts]

06:05.188 --> 06:06.608
What the hell is this thing...?

06:06.691 --> 06:07.693
[soldier 1] <i>You there!</i>

06:08.361 --> 06:11.868
<i>Is Neo-Britannia behind this, Lady Vaughn?</i>

06:11.952 --> 06:14.122
-[Narah] <i>What are you talking about?</i>
-[soldier 2] <i>Don't move!</i>

06:14.206 --> 06:17.337
<i>Take one more step,
and we'll have no choice but to shoot you.</i>

06:18.674 --> 06:19.926
[Shiro] <i>Lower your guns!</i>

06:21.345 --> 06:22.347
[soldier 2] <i>But sir!</i>

06:22.430 --> 06:25.980
Did you not see what Lady Vaughn just did?

06:26.731 --> 06:30.405
She saved the life of one of our men,
and you point guns at her in thanks?

06:30.488 --> 06:32.868
No wonder peace is a distant dream.

06:33.202 --> 06:36.543
I appreciate your support,
Commander Sazanami.

06:36.626 --> 06:37.837
[alarm beeping]

06:38.170 --> 06:40.509
[Narah] <i>I assure you, I am not your enemy.</i>

06:41.135 --> 06:43.640
Please judge me
based on my actions moving forward.

06:46.646 --> 06:48.232
[Ash] <i>What's wrong, Rozé?</i>

06:48.817 --> 06:52.490
Is it really okay for me
to act so selfishly at a time like this?

06:52.825 --> 06:54.244
[Kuroto] <i>Your mission is vital.</i>

06:54.327 --> 06:58.294
Rozé, you must go immediately
to the rescue of Sakuya Sumeragi.

06:58.795 --> 06:59.797
But...

06:59.881 --> 07:00.883
[Kuroto] <i>Don't worry.</i>

07:01.133 --> 07:04.473
<i>Leave Luxembourg to us.</i>

07:04.891 --> 07:07.437
It's all right.
We're already on our way there.

07:07.897 --> 07:10.611
I'll be there to save the day in style!

07:11.070 --> 07:13.199
About time you did something useful.

07:13.282 --> 07:14.326
[Oda] <i>Shut up!</i>

07:14.619 --> 07:19.336
[Yuri] The Artemis, no, the Ortygia
can get to the palace in no time flat.

07:19.670 --> 07:21.591
So, we've got this.

07:21.674 --> 07:24.304
You two don't worry.
Just focus on saving the Empress.

07:24.931 --> 07:27.603
We're counting on you, Rozé.

07:28.020 --> 07:30.233
Thank you, everyone.

07:31.778 --> 07:34.742
Well then, we'll be on our way.

07:46.599 --> 07:47.977
GOVERNMENT OFFICE
IMPERIAL MANOR

07:48.060 --> 07:49.647
[Walther] Your Majesty, please wait.

07:51.441 --> 07:53.697
You heard about the incident
in the Luxembourg Domain.

07:53.989 --> 07:55.826
Haven't you, Sir Lindstedt?

07:56.076 --> 07:59.709
If it's true, Norland must know something.

07:59.792 --> 08:01.588
Even if he does,

08:01.671 --> 08:04.426
do you think that man
would admit to anything?

08:04.927 --> 08:08.392
On the contrary, he may become aggressive,
which could put you in danger.

08:08.894 --> 08:10.021
But...

08:10.104 --> 08:12.400
You may be a stand-in for Empress Sakuya,

08:12.483 --> 08:14.780
but you are still the highest authority
in this country.

08:15.323 --> 08:18.329
Consider what only you can do
given your position.

08:19.540 --> 08:21.293
What only I can do...

08:22.420 --> 08:23.632
You are right.

08:24.257 --> 08:26.638
I will do what only I can do.

08:27.013 --> 08:29.184
-[mechs approaching]
-[gasps softly]

08:29.644 --> 08:30.646
[both gasp]

08:36.490 --> 08:38.494
[rumbling]

08:49.391 --> 08:51.228
All right, now! To the second floor!

08:51.353 --> 08:52.355
[Mei] Got it!

08:52.438 --> 08:54.735
[both panting]

08:55.821 --> 08:58.200
Mei! Get to Princess Sakuya's room!

09:01.206 --> 09:02.960
Boss, do you have any weapons?

09:03.043 --> 09:06.341
All used up. Not sure how much longer
we can hold down this place.

09:06.425 --> 09:09.515
What?! Don't say that!

09:12.020 --> 09:13.147
Here it comes.

09:18.198 --> 09:19.492
[Oda] <i>Sorry to keep you waiting!</i>

09:19.577 --> 09:22.040
[Shota] <i>Now, how to deal with this thing?</i>

09:22.498 --> 09:24.712
[Oda] <i>My bazooka
didn't have much of an effect.</i>

09:25.129 --> 09:26.381
[Shota] <i>Well...</i>

09:26.465 --> 09:28.385
[Oda] <i>Look how big this thing is!</i>

09:28.469 --> 09:29.555
[Shota] <i>Fair.</i>

09:29.638 --> 09:30.641
Here it comes!

09:33.938 --> 09:35.024
[Oda] <i>Munemori!</i>

09:36.653 --> 09:38.364
This is real bad!

09:50.555 --> 09:52.308
I thought I was done for...

09:53.143 --> 09:55.398
[Oda] <i>How can one machine
have all that power?</i>

09:55.481 --> 09:57.443
[Shota] <i>Seriously.
You gotta be kidding me.</i>

09:58.487 --> 10:03.205
And these things are being spread
all over the world...?

10:13.016 --> 10:14.352
[Walther] Let's head underground.

10:14.436 --> 10:15.438
[Sakura] Okay.

10:16.566 --> 10:19.822
Which side is responsible
for that machine?

10:22.326 --> 10:23.663
[Ash] <i>We're almost there.</i>

10:23.746 --> 10:25.625
<i>Handing over the controls to you.</i>

10:25.709 --> 10:27.003
Roger that, Ash.

10:30.552 --> 10:34.810
The imperial manor is... destroyed...

10:35.604 --> 10:38.025
[Ash] <i>They could have evacuated
to another location.</i>

10:38.442 --> 10:40.362
Let's land the Ortygia and search.

10:43.620 --> 10:46.709
Oh, you're still alive...

10:48.462 --> 10:54.057
Some weird machine is rampaging up there,
and now I've run into you. Just my luck!

10:54.140 --> 10:55.769
[Sakura] Lady Sabathra.

10:56.269 --> 10:58.983
So annoying. Can you just leave already?

10:59.067 --> 11:02.950
Would you consider
working together with us?

11:03.660 --> 11:04.703
Please!

11:05.079 --> 11:06.081
[Catherine] Excuse me?

11:06.164 --> 11:08.210
Your Majesty, what are you thinking?

11:08.628 --> 11:12.260
I cannot afford to die yet.

11:12.719 --> 11:15.725
[scoffs] So now that
you're on the brink of death,

11:15.809 --> 11:17.521
you're begging for help?

11:18.063 --> 11:20.317
That's just the trouble with weak people.

11:20.819 --> 11:24.492
I may only be a puppet Empress.

11:24.577 --> 11:30.462
However, if I act now,
I might be able to save a few more lives.

11:31.214 --> 11:34.930
I want to fulfill my duty.

11:35.807 --> 11:36.934
[Sakura] No.

11:37.018 --> 11:38.897
I <i>must</i> fulfill my duty.

11:40.817 --> 11:42.946
You've changed a bit.

11:43.447 --> 11:46.286
-[explosion]
-[rumbling]

11:46.787 --> 11:48.583
It isn't safe to stay here.

11:48.666 --> 11:49.960
It would appear not.

11:50.294 --> 11:51.631
[Catherine] Follow me.

11:52.089 --> 11:55.555
I'll show you a route
you can't access on your own.

11:55.639 --> 11:56.641
[both gasp softly]

11:58.435 --> 12:01.316
Hurry up, or I'll leave you behind.

12:22.233 --> 12:23.611
[Arnold] Ash...

12:28.078 --> 12:29.247
[grunts exasperatedly]

12:31.459 --> 12:33.171
[Sakuya] <i>Where is Sakura?</i>

12:34.925 --> 12:35.927
<i>It's okay.</i>

12:37.013 --> 12:38.223
<i>She must be somewhere safe...</i>

12:41.772 --> 12:43.776
[Rozé panting]

12:45.487 --> 12:48.661
The imperial manor is empty.

12:50.038 --> 12:51.041
I see...

12:51.834 --> 12:53.880
[Rozé] Ash? Is this...

12:53.963 --> 12:55.633
Norland's quarters.

13:00.894 --> 13:01.937
[Sakuya] Ash.

13:02.271 --> 13:05.069
If Norland is inside,
I'll use my Geass immediately.

13:05.570 --> 13:07.783
When I do, cover your ears.

13:08.283 --> 13:09.368
All right.

13:17.051 --> 13:18.470
[Sakuya] A hidden passage?

13:24.232 --> 13:25.442
<i>The Loki...?</i>

13:26.319 --> 13:29.075
<i>Were those machines made here?</i>

13:29.492 --> 13:32.081
<i>But why attack the palace?</i>

13:34.586 --> 13:36.422
There's something underground! Ash!

13:36.507 --> 13:38.260
Norland might be down there!

13:38.343 --> 13:39.680
And Sakura as well!

13:40.472 --> 13:42.393
[breath trembling]

14:05.480 --> 14:10.157
Is forcing others into submission
through violence really strength?

14:11.827 --> 14:13.288
[sighs softly]

14:42.889 --> 14:45.853
[Catherine] <i>In that shining moment,</i>

14:45.979 --> 14:48.526
<i>Lord Norland was cool as hell.</i>

14:50.530 --> 14:54.453
[Sakura] To me, that sounds like
a lonely kind of strength.

14:55.790 --> 14:58.796
[Catherine] <i>I've always felt
that absolute power</i>

14:58.879 --> 15:01.217
<i>was the ultimate strength...</i>

15:01.384 --> 15:04.891
<i>But now? I'm not so sure anymore...</i>

15:05.392 --> 15:07.897
I know what true strength looks like.

15:10.737 --> 15:13.324
[Catherine] You told me, didn't you?

15:13.826 --> 15:16.122
That you know
what true strength looks like.

15:17.917 --> 15:20.548
What kind of strength
were you talking about?

15:24.890 --> 15:28.438
I may be weak, but...

15:28.773 --> 15:31.235
Having the heart
to use what little power you have

15:31.319 --> 15:34.910
to do something for someone else...

15:35.912 --> 15:39.753
That's what I believe true strength is.

15:42.049 --> 15:44.554
[sighs] I see.

15:46.642 --> 15:49.815
That gives you Queen-level clearance.

15:50.733 --> 15:51.819
Over there.

15:52.069 --> 15:55.868
That's the exit,
so just leave through there. See ya.

15:55.952 --> 15:56.954
Where are you going?

15:57.371 --> 16:00.377
[Catherine]
I'm free to go wherever I want, aren't I?

16:00.460 --> 16:02.422
You two can handle this on your own.

16:02.924 --> 16:06.139
I really do hate babysitting...

16:06.640 --> 16:08.226
Lady Sabathra...

16:09.646 --> 16:16.409
[sighs] <i>Like, I get it,
but it's still kinda bugging me.</i>

16:20.877 --> 16:21.879
[Sakuya] Ash?

16:22.379 --> 16:23.381
Ash?

16:24.425 --> 16:25.636
Ash!

16:27.014 --> 16:28.183
[Ash] I'm all right.

16:28.349 --> 16:30.605
[Arnold laughs] You sure about that?

16:31.355 --> 16:33.484
You seem pretty rattled.

16:34.486 --> 16:35.823
[Ash] Stop!

16:35.907 --> 16:37.117
Don't get involved.

16:38.369 --> 16:39.581
State your demands.

16:40.165 --> 16:42.294
Straight to the point.

16:42.629 --> 16:46.970
Well then, let's settle this
with a duel to the death.

16:48.557 --> 16:51.563
[Arnold] Using those weapons
that mean so much to you.

16:52.941 --> 16:55.905
[Ash] Rozé, you go ahead and find Norland.

16:55.988 --> 16:56.990
[Sakuya] Okay.

16:57.825 --> 16:58.911
I'll catch up soon.

16:59.746 --> 17:02.334
Take up your sword! Ash!

17:07.094 --> 17:11.143
[Arnold laughs]
It's finally just you and me!

17:15.569 --> 17:18.074
[grunts] Not falling for that.

17:37.404 --> 17:40.452
I, Sakuya Sumeragi, command you! Obey me!

17:42.707 --> 17:44.836
I've taken all
the necessary countermeasures.

17:44.919 --> 17:47.382
Your Geass won't work on me.

18:00.116 --> 18:02.705
[Sakuya] Those machines
swallowing people whole...

18:03.122 --> 18:04.458
You're the one who made them.

18:05.126 --> 18:06.087
[Norland] Yes.

18:07.507 --> 18:11.138
Killing people indiscriminately...

18:14.896 --> 18:16.858
[Sakuya] What are you
trying to accomplish?

18:16.942 --> 18:18.737
[Norland] The extermination of humanity.

18:18.821 --> 18:19.989
Extermination?

18:21.910 --> 18:23.956
How can you treat human like vermin?!

18:24.833 --> 18:26.795
Humans, huh...

18:31.429 --> 18:36.355
[Norland] Come to think of it,
you are of Britannian royal blood.

18:43.996 --> 18:45.331
[gasps]

18:52.763 --> 18:54.057
[Sakuya] Grandfather...

18:54.684 --> 18:56.228
Charles...?

19:07.710 --> 19:10.758
Let's make one thing clear.

19:11.342 --> 19:14.264
Whoever wins this wins it all!

19:23.951 --> 19:26.288
I... win.

19:28.669 --> 19:31.215
Ash!

19:36.100 --> 19:37.185
Are you...

19:38.229 --> 19:40.191
really my grandfather?

19:40.776 --> 19:44.993
Yes. Genetically speaking,
we are the same person.

19:46.287 --> 19:47.957
[Sakuya] How is that possible...?

19:48.584 --> 19:51.130
[Norland] I was created by humans
to serve as

19:51.213 --> 19:53.969
a new vessel for Charles zi Britannia.

19:55.054 --> 19:57.017
[Sakuya] <i>So he's a clone?</i>

19:57.518 --> 20:01.735
The plan was to transfer
Charles' mind into me,

20:01.818 --> 20:04.406
but he died before that could happen,

20:04.907 --> 20:07.245
leaving me an empty vessel.

20:07.788 --> 20:09.291
Don't tell me...

20:09.374 --> 20:12.213
Are you planning
to recreate his reign of terror?

20:12.715 --> 20:13.967
[Norland] No.

20:14.051 --> 20:17.850
Then why the Loki?!
Why create such terrifying machines...

20:19.019 --> 20:21.983
What is it you're scheming?!

20:22.484 --> 20:24.947
[Norland] I told you. Extermination.

20:25.574 --> 20:29.582
The annihilation of all humanity.

20:29.916 --> 20:30.918
[powers up]

20:31.418 --> 20:32.462
[Sakuya] All...

20:33.255 --> 20:35.552
But you're human just like the rest of us!

20:36.053 --> 20:38.850
Not... like the rest of you.

20:40.436 --> 20:44.069
[Sakuya] <i>He considers himself
separate from humanity...</i>

20:45.363 --> 20:47.325
Why such hostility towards humanity?

20:48.369 --> 20:50.373
[Norland] Hostility is inaccurate.

20:50.916 --> 20:52.628
[Sakuya] So this is
a grand murder-suicide?

20:53.129 --> 20:54.089
[Norland] No.

20:54.590 --> 20:56.511
[Sakuya] Judgment on a civilization
gone too far?

20:56.594 --> 20:57.596
[Norland] No.

20:58.472 --> 20:59.726
Nature worship?

20:59.809 --> 21:00.811
[Norland] No.

21:01.311 --> 21:02.690
Hedonism?

21:02.773 --> 21:03.900
[Norland] No.

21:04.443 --> 21:05.612
Nihilism?

21:06.113 --> 21:07.282
[Norland] No.

21:08.075 --> 21:11.206
[Sakuya] <i>I don't get it...
It makes no sense...</i>

21:12.208 --> 21:13.545
Revenge against humanity?

21:13.628 --> 21:14.797
[Norland] No.

21:14.881 --> 21:15.924
[Sakuya] Admiration?

21:16.008 --> 21:17.010
No.

21:17.093 --> 21:18.722
[Sakuya] A desire to be acknowledged?

21:18.805 --> 21:19.849
No.

21:21.310 --> 21:24.107
[Sakuya] Just plain... disgust?!

21:38.929 --> 21:41.810
[whirs, trills]

21:46.861 --> 21:48.072
[Norland] <i>Excellent...</i>

21:49.867 --> 21:55.879
<i>All information
flows through the Foulbout and into me.</i>

22:17.548 --> 22:18.675
[Ash] <i>That machine...</i>

22:19.510 --> 22:21.263
<i>Is it Norland?</i>

22:34.039 --> 22:38.005
Now, I will finally... be able to sleep.

22:38.590 --> 22:40.594
[♪ closing theme song playing]

24:05.972 --> 24:07.976
Translated by [Kenji Mouri]
